        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 2:39AM EDT until September 25 at 6:00PM EDT by NWS Upton NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 20 to 30 kt with occasional gusts up to
35 kt and seas 3 to 5 feet.

* WHERE...Long Island Sound west of Port Jefferson and New
Haven, and New York Harbor.

* WHEN...Until 6 PM EDT Friday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
